				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-02-04T22:23:00.284421+08:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "tlUrLrPpDQC9gbAxCuWJVQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Most citizens upon the collapse were bitterly annexed into the Alliance for Unix. Many took the opportunity to embrace the greener pastures found within the big empire, however for others a lost cause was formed. Of note, this has lead to several underground religious orders forming and empires that have found themselves in the outskirts of the Alliances borders."
			},
